{
 "data": [
  {
   "uuid": "67b6c401-1017-4c39-93f6-8305c4c67f69",
   "slug": "absolutezero",
   "name": "AbsoluteZero",
   "class_name": "COOL_ACOM_S02_AbsoluteZero_SCItem",
   "classification": "Ship.Cooler",
   "classification_label": "Cooler",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "Originally designed for racers, the AbsoluteZero cooler pushes performance to the limits. This high quality component from ACOM features a new coolant cycling system to keep your ship's systems cool over everything else.",
    "de_DE": "Hersteller: ACOM\nTyp (En): Cooler\nTyp (De): K\u00fchler\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S2\nG\u00fctegrad: B\nKlasse: Competition (Wettkampf)\n\nUrspr\u00fcnglich f\u00fcr Rennfahrer entwickelt, dr\u00fcckt der AbsoluteZero-K\u00fchler die Leistungsgrenzen. Diese hochwertige Komponente von ACOM verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber ein neues K\u00fchlmittelsystem, um Ihr Schiffssystem \u00fcber alles andere k\u00fchl zu halten.",
    "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u51b7\u5374\u5668\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1aACOM\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a2\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1aB \n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u7ade\u8d5b\n\n\u8d77\u521d\u4e13\u4e3a\u8d5b\u8247\u8bbe\u8ba1\u7684\"\u7edd\u5bf9\u96f6\u5ea6\"\u51b7\u5374\u5668\u80fd\u8ba9\u6027\u80fd\u53d1\u6325\u5230\u6781\u81f4.\u8fd9\u6b3e\u6765\u81ea\u8230\u8239\u90e8\u4ef6\u5236\u9020\u5546 (ACOM)\u7684\u9ad8\u54c1\u8d28\u7ec4\u4ef6\u4eae\u70b9\u662f\u4e00\u5957\u5168\u65b0\u7684\u51b7\u5374\u6db2\u5faa\u73af\u7cfb\u7edf\uff0c\u80fd\u8ba9\u60a8\u7684\u98de\u8239\u7cfb\u7edf\u6563\u70ed\u6548\u679c\u80dc\u8fc7\u4e00\u5207\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Type d'article : Refroidisseur\nFabricant : ACOM\nTaille : 2\nQualit\u00e9 : B\nClasse : Comp\u00e9tition\n\nCon\u00e7u \u00e0 l'origine pour les coureurs, le refroidisseur AbsoluteZero repousse les limites de la performance. Ce composant ACOM de haute qualit\u00e9 est dot\u00e9 d'un nouveau syst\u00e8me de circulation du liquide de refroidissement afin de maintenir les syst\u00e8mes de votre vaisseau au frais avant toute autre chose."
   },
