  {
   "uuid": "115aaff9-c8c5-4b93-bc14-9f22524fe8a8",
   "slug": "algid",
   "name": "Algid",
   "class_name": "COOL_AEGS_S04_Reclaimer",
   "classification": "Ship.Cooler",
   "classification_label": "Cooler",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "The Reclaimer is a ship renowned for its ability to work long and hard. To help support even the most arduous salvaging projects, Aegis develop the bespoke Algid cooler.",
    "de_DE": "Hersteller: Aegis Dynamics\nTyp (En): Cooler\nTyp (De): K\u00fchler\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S4\nG\u00fctegrad: Individuell angefertigt\nKlasse: Industrial (Industrie)\n\nDie Reclaimer ist bekannt daf\u00fcr, lange und hart zu arbeiten. Um auch die anspruchsvollsten Verwertungsarbeiten zu unterst\u00fctzen, hat Aegis den ma\u00dfgeschneiderten Algid-K\u00fchler entwickelt.",
    "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u51b7\u5374\u5668\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u5723\u76fe\u52a8\u529b\uff08Aegis Dynamics\uff09\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a4\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1a\u5b9a\u5236\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u5de5\u4e1a\n\n\u56de\u6536\u8005\u4ee5\u5176\u575a\u82e5\u78d0\u77f3\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\u80fd\u529b\u800c\u95fb\u540d\u3002\u4e3a\u4e86\u8fdb\u884c\u6700\u8270\u96be\u7684\u6253\u635e\u4f5c\u4e1a\uff0c\u5723\u76fe\u4e13\u95e8\u4e3a\u5176\u5f00\u53d1\u4e86\u98ce\u5bd2\u51b7\u5374\u5668",
    "fr_FR": "Type d'article : Refroidisseur\nFabricant : Aegis Dynamics\nTaille : 4\nQualit\u00e9 : Sur mesure\nClasse : Industriel\n\nLe Reclaimer est un vaisseau renomm\u00e9 pour sa capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 travailler longtemps et dur. Pour aider \u00e0 soutenir m\u00eame les projets de r\u00e9cup\u00e9ration les plus ardus, Aegis a d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 le refroidisseur Algid sur mesure."
   },
